The '''ALGS: 2025 Midseason Playoffs''' is the second event in the 25-26 ALGS Calendar. Initially announced after the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2025/Championship|ALGS 2025 Championship]] in the roadmap, it was later announced on May 20th, 2025 that the Midseason Playoffs became a part of the [[esports:Esports_World_Cup/2025|Esports World Cup]]. Revamping the tournaments format, and doubling the prize pool from the initial $1,000,000 {{Abbr/USD}} to $2,000,000 {{Abbr/USD}}

:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2025 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2025, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

==Format==
===Pool Play===
* 40 teams will be split into 2 even groups of 20 teams each and compete in a series of 10 games.
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 7 teams of each group}} will advance to the ''Finals''.
** {{bgcolortext|stay|8-17 placed teams}} of each group will advance to the ''Last Chance''.
** {{bgcolortext|down|18-20th placed teams}} are eliminated.

===Last Chance Qualifier===
* 20 teams will compete in a series of 10 games.
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 6 teams}} will advance to the ''Finals''.
** {{bgcolortext|down|7-20th placed teams}} are eliminated.

===Finals===
* The 20 remaining teams will compete in the {{Abbr/MatchPoint/50}}


